      "problem": "$11$ is **not** a prime number, or $15$ is **not** divisible by $5.$\n\nExpress the compound statement above in symbolic form given the following:\n\n- $P:11\\text{ is a prime number}$\n\n- $Q:15\\text{ is divisible by }5$",
